@startuml
title exact-orb — HTTP Build Natal: validation, deadline, admission и outcome

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Клиент" as Client
boundary "POST /charts/natal" as API
control "AdmissionControl\n(calculation)" as Admission
control "ApplicationOrchestrator" as Orch
control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler
control "ContextService" as Context
database "SessionPersistence" as Store
collections "Журнал" as Log

Client -> API : JSON birth fields + cookie
API -> Log : http_request_started(request_id, route)

alt service shutting down
    API --> Client : 503 SERVICE_SHUTTING_DOWN; Retry-After: 30\ncookie unchanged
else trusted forwarding invalid
    API --> Client : 400 FORWARDED_HEADER_INVALID; cookie unchanged
else Origin rejected
    API --> Client : 403 ORIGIN_NOT_ALLOWED; cookie unchanged
else media type / encoding rejected
    API --> Client : 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE; cookie unchanged
else body slow / too large
    API --> Client : 408 REQUEST_TIMEOUT + Retry-After:1\n/ 413 REQUEST_TOO_LARGE; cookie unchanged
else JSON/schema rejected
    API --> Client : 422 INVALID_REQUEST + field issues\ncookie unchanged
else cookie missing / invalid / duplicated
    API --> Client : 409 SESSION_REQUIRED; clear if present
else transport-valid request
    API -> Log : http_message send AdmissionControl.reserve
    API -> Admission : reserve(session_id, client_ip, calculation)
    note right of Admission
    Evaluate four rate buckets before capacity without mutation.
    Dominant exhausted bucket has latest next-admission time;
    ties: session before IP, 24h before 1h.
    Rate rejection is 429; capacity rejection is 503.
    Neither rejection consumes quota or permit.
    end note

    alt rate/capacity rejected
        Admission --> API : rejected(code, detail, retry_after)
        API -> Log : http_message receive AdmissionRejected
        API -> Log : http_admission_rejected(code, detail)
        API --> Client : 429 + computed Retry-After\n/ 503 capacity + Retry-After:1; cookie unchanged
    else admitted
        Admission --> API : permit
        API -> Log : http_message receive AdmissionPermit
        API -> API : RunContext(request_id, started_at,\ndeadline=+30s)
        API -> Log : http_message send ApplicationOrchestrator.execute
        API -> Orch : execute(BuildNatalCommand, session_id, run)\nunder monotonic response deadline

        Orch -> Context : load(session_id)
        Context -> Store : touch(session_id, now)
        Store --> Context : SessionSnapshot / typed outcome
        Context --> Orch : typed outcome

        alt live snapshot
            Orch -> Handler : handle(command, current state, run)
            Handler --> Orch : success / InputRequired / typed failure
            alt BuildNatalSuccess
                Orch -> Context : save(original expected, delta)
                Context -> Store : atomic CAS state + StoredChart
                Store --> Context : Committed / AlreadyApplied /\nSuperseded / failure
                Context --> Orch : typed commit outcome
            end
        end

        alt execute returned typed result
            Orch --> API : ApplicationResult
            API -> Log : http_message receive ApplicationResult

            alt Committed
                API --> Client : 200 chart_ready + committed ChartDTO; renew
            else AlreadyApplied
                API --> Client : 200 already_applied; no request artifact; renew
            else InputRequired / typed dependency failure / Superseded
                API --> Client : 422 / 503 Retry-After:5 / 409; renew after successful load
            else StateCommitFailed
                API --> Client : 503 STATE_COMMIT_FAILED; retryable=true\nRetry-After:1; renew; only GET current recovery
            else StateReadFailed
                API --> Client : 503 STATE_READ_FAILED; Retry-After:5\ncookie unchanged
            else SessionAbsent
                API --> Client : 409 session code; clear cookie
            else internal failure
                API --> Client : 500 INTERNAL_FAILURE; internal code hidden
            end
        else response deadline / disconnect
            API --> Client : 504 BUILD_TIMEOUT; retryable=false; Retry-After:5\nno Set-Cookie (unchanged) if connection exists
            note over API, Orch
            Accepted task remains registered.
            Protected commit is retained and awaited.
            Each accepted request retains its own permit.
            A cancelled single-flight waiter keeps its permit
            while the joined leader remains active.
            M1-6 may wait for all leaders in the cancellation snapshot;
            unrelated leaders can delay release.
            SQLite/catalog executor futures are retained separately.
            Socket loss or cancelled execute does not release permit.
            M1-6 option C: at 30s watchdog marks process unhealthy;
            health becomes 503 and external supervisor restarts process.
            The deadline does not promise actual permit release.
            Target state A moves calculation to a dedicated worker process.
            end note
        end

        API -> Log : if terminal before restart:
http_message send AdmissionControl.release
        API -> Admission : release after retained leader/commit/leaf work
        Admission --> API : released
        API -> Log : http_message receive AdmissionReleased
    end
end

API -> Log : http_request_finished(status, code, duration)

note over API, Store
POST покрывает first build и explicit rebuild.
После STATE_COMMIT_FAILED или BUILD_TIMEOUT клиент делает
GET /charts/current, а не автоматический повтор POST.
До supervisor restart current не доказывает terminal failure;
после restart current является authoritative.
Новый разрешённый POST всегда делает fresh load.
end note

@enduml
